  "description": "This policy setting allows you to audit events generated by the management of task scheduler jobs or COM+ objects. For scheduler jobs, the following are audited:\n\n• Job created.\n• Job deleted.\n• Job enabled.\n• Job disabled.\n• Job updated.\n\nFor COM+ objects, the following are audited:\n\n• Catalog object added.\n• Catalog object updated.\n• Catalog object deleted.\n\nThe recommended state for this setting is: Success and Failure.\n",
